# inputs/tcl/

TCL input scripts sourced by generated Vivado hook files.

## Files

sem_gen.tcl     - SEM IP generation (sourced by pre_synthesis.tcl if FI enabled)
report_gen.tcl  - Vivado report commands (sourced by pre_bitstream.tcl)

## Usage

These input scripts are:
1. Copied to tmp/tcl/ during file movement phase
2. Sourced by generated hook scripts (pre_synthesis.tcl, pre_bitstream.tcl)
3. Executed by Vivado during build process
